Python virtual environment & cache files
These are specific to your local machine and don't need to be shared.
venv/
pycache/
*.pyc

Secret files that should NEVER be shared publicly
This is the most important section for security.
.env
credentials.json

IDE and OS specific files
These are just clutter and can cause issues for other team members.
.vscode/
.DS_Store
serviceAccountKey.json
service-account-key.json